Z||000000||Fie Ro||12-04-2001||09:45 AM||||Last year my Fiero wouldn't start. Fuelpump was replaced. Also replaced the fuelfilter myself, it was very dirty inside. The company that replaced the fuelpump also found out that 3 injectors were cracked in half!!!! They replaced them with some used ones.<P>Now  my fiero will not start again and i'm thinking I have the same problem. I have fuel plus spark, see topic: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/014454.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/014454.html</A> <P>Has anyone ever had broken injectors? What will cause them to break: Too high voltage or fuel contamination? Engine has 135Kmiles...<P>And would injectors from a 2.8 or 3.1 Beretta /corsica work?<BR>thanks<BR>Roderick||||reg||5
