Z||000017||Fie Ro||12-18-2001||05:49 AM||||Well, I have them back.<BR>They al flow 41/42 now. Testing before cleaning showed:<BR>37 / 39 / 36 / 26 (!) / 39 / 39.<BR>2 injectors were leaking. The cold start injector didn't work electrically, it could be stuck so I ordered a new one. Waiting for that one.<P>So I guess this job was worthwhile although expensive (about $200). I hope it will get my Fiero back on the road....||||reg||1
